message: "If you use RankProbe, cite this software and record the exact commit."
title: "RankProbe: Inspectable audits of exported ranking evaluations"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Borui"
    family-names: "Ma"
    alias: "C4LLM3LUC4S"
version: 0.1.0a3
abstract: >-
  A local tool for inspecting candidate-score ties, duplicated items, relevance
  coverage, and run comparability in exported ranking evaluations. The software
  reports its evaluation assumptions and does not certify complete experiments.
